Package: yamaa
Title: Clean-Room R Derivation Engine for the yamaa Specification Language
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-09-26
Authors@R: person("elong0527-muse-bot", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "329371256+elong0527-muse-bot@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: A clean-room R implementation of the yamaa derivation engine:
    specification loading (including parents: composition), row
    construction, column derivation, window expressions, lookups,
    temporal and text operations, verifications, and artifact publishing,
    driven by the schema and rules in yaml/ and validated against
    benchmarks/. Self-contained: base R plus the yaml and arrow packages.
